#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#35269"
msgid "Toggle this setting to log in or out of RetroAchievements."
msgstr ""
"Växla denna inställning för att logga in eller ut från RetroAchievements."

#. Description for notification event regarding unsuccessful RetroAchievements
#. login
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#35270"
msgid ""
"Your account is not verified. Please check your email to complete your sign "
"up."
msgstr ""
"Ditt konto är inte verifierat. Kontrollera din e-post för att slutföra din "
"registrering."

#. Error message shown when an OpenGL game is played, as OpenGL is not
#. currently supported
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#35271"
msgid ""
"This game requires OpenGL support for 3D rendering. OpenGL support is still "
"under development."
msgstr ""
"Detta spel kräver OpenGL-stöd för 3D-rendering. OpenGL-stöd är fortfarande "
"under utveckling."

#. Label for the "Disc menu" button to open the Disc Manager when playing a
#. game
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#35272"
msgid "Disc menu"
msgstr "Skivmeny"

#. Label for showing the disc that is inserted in the game's virtual CD drive
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#35273"
msgid "Disc selection"
msgstr "Skivval"

#. Text shown when a disc is removed from the game's virtual CD drive
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#35274"
msgid "No disc"
msgstr "Ingen skiva"

#. Label for the button that ejects the disc for a game's virtual CD drive
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#35275"
msgid "Eject"
msgstr "Mata ut"

#. Label for the button that inserts the disc (closes the disc tray) for a
