#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#35325"
msgid "Multiple cheat packs match this game. Choose one to load its cheats."
msgstr ""
"Flera fuskpaket passar det här spelet. Välj ett paket för att läsa in "
"fuskkoderna."

#. Enabled-cheat count, singular
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#35326"
msgid "1 cheat enabled"
msgstr "1 fuskkod aktiverad"

#. Enabled-cheat count, including zero
#, c++-format, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#35327"
msgid "{0:d} cheats enabled"
msgstr "{0:d} fuskkoder aktiverade"

