msgstr "Endast tillgänglig med manuell undertextposition"

#. Help text for setting "Use system HDR/SDR brightness balance" of label
#. #36096
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39190"
msgid ""
"[ON] The brightness of the GUI in HDR mode follows the system's setting. "
"This affects all OSD, subtitles and graphics that are SDR in "
"origin.[CR][OFF] Set the max brightness manually."
msgstr ""
"[PÅ] Ljusstyrkan för grafiskt användargränssnitt i HDR-läge följer systemets"
" inställning. Detta påverkar alla OSD, undertexter och grafik som är SDR i "
"ursprung.[CR][AV] Ställ in max ljusstyrka manuellt."

#. System / Display "HDR" settings group label
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39191"
msgid "HDR"
msgstr "HDR"

#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39192"
msgid "Disable screensaver when playing audio"
msgstr "Inaktivera skärmsläckaren när ljud spelas upp"

#. Description of setting with label #39192 "Disable screensaver when playing
#. audio"
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39193"
msgid "If music is being played, the screensaver will never be activated"
msgstr "Om musik spelas kommer skärmsläckaren aldrig att aktiveras"

#. Help text of setting "Allow use DXVA Video Super Resolution" with label
#. #13417
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39194"
msgid ""
"Enables advanced DXVA upscaler using NVIDIA \"RTX Video Super Resolution\" "
"or \"Intel Video Super Resolution\".[CR]Used when the video source is "
"2560x1440 or less and the source resolution is lower than the display "
"resolution.[CR]Only available on specific hardware: NVIDIA RTX and Intel "
"Arc."
msgstr ""
"Aktiverar avancerad DXVA-uppskalning med hjälp av NVIDIA ”RTX Video Super "
"Resolution” eller ”Intel Video Super Resolution”.[CR]Används när videokällan"
" är 2560x1440 eller mindre och källans upplösning är lägre än bildskärmens "
"upplösning.[CR]Endast tillgänglig på specifik maskinvara: NVIDIA RTX och "
"Intel Arc."

#. Description of setting with label #13418 "Use high precision processing"
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39195"
msgid ""
"Enable this option for the best picture quality. Disabling reduces the load "
"on resource-limited systems."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera detta alternativ för bästa möjliga bildkvalitet. Om du inaktiverar "
"minskar belastningen på resursbegränsade system."

#. Title of Dolby Vision RPU conversion setting
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39196"
msgid "Dolby Vision compatibility mode"
msgstr "Kompatibilitetsläge för Dolby Vision"

#. Help text for setting "Convert Dolby Vision for compatibility" of label
#. #39196
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39197"
msgid ""
"If enabled, Dolby Vision profile 7 will be converted to profile 8.1, which "
"is more commonly supported by devices. Enable if your device supports Dolby "
"Vision, but has issues with some videos."
msgstr ""
"Om den är aktiverad konverteras Dolby Vision-profil 7 till profil 8.1, som "
"oftast stöds av enheter. Aktivera om din enhet stöder Dolby Vision, men har "
"problem med vissa videor."

#. Title of "Allowed HDR dynamic metadata formats" setting
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39198"
msgid "Allowed HDR dynamic metadata formats"
msgstr "Tillåtna dynamiska metadataformat för HDR"

#. Help text for setting "Allowed HDR dynamic metadata formats" of label
#. #39198
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39199"
msgid ""
"Alters the video bitstream to remove dynamic HDR metadata. Select the HDR "
"formats your device and display supports."
msgstr ""
"Ändrar videobitströmmen för att ta bort dynamiska HDR-metadata. Välj de HDR-"
"format som din enhet och skärm stöder."

#. Label of Dolby Vision option for setting "Allowed HDR dynamic metadata
#. formats" of label #39198
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39200"
msgid "Dolby Vision"
msgstr "Dolby Vision"

#. Label of HDR10+ option for setting "Allowed HDR dynamic metadata formats"
#. of label #39198
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39201"
msgid "HDR10+"
msgstr "HDR10+"

#. Subtitle line spacing setting
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39202"
msgid "Line spacing"
msgstr "Radavstånd"

#. Subtitle line spacing setting help
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39203"
msgid ""
"Adjust the space between lines of text. Setting a value too low may cause "
"boxes to overlap when the \"Background type\" setting is used."
msgstr ""
"Justera avståndet mellan textraderna. Om du ställer in ett för lågt värde "
"kan det hända att rutorna överlappar varandra när inställningen "
"\"Bakgrundstyp\" används."

#. Setting to make CC subtitles for hearing impaired only
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39204"
msgid "Set CC subtitles only for the hearing impaired"
msgstr "Ställ in CC-undertexter endast för hörselskadade"

#. Help text for setting of label #39204
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39205"
msgid ""
"By enabling it, CC subtitles will be labeled for the hearing impaired; this "
"will affect the automatic selection of subtitles, which unless otherwise "
"specified will not be displayed by default."
msgstr ""
"Om du aktiverar den kommer CC-undertexter att märkas för hörselskadade; "
"detta påverkar det automatiska valet av undertexter, som om inget annat "
"anges inte kommer att visas som standard."

#. Abbreviation for Closed Caption subtitles (subtitles embedded in videos)
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39206"
msgid "CC"
msgstr "CC"

#. Use Starfish decoder
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39207"
msgid "Use Starfish decoder"
msgstr "Använd Starfish-avkodaren"

#. Description of setting with label #39207 "Use Starfish decoder"
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39208"
msgid ""
"Starfish is the hardware video decoder for LG's webOS. Disable it for "
"troubleshooting or testing."
msgstr ""
"Starfish är hårdvaruvideoavkodaren för LG:s webOS. Inaktivera den för "
"felsökning eller testning."

#. Title of Dolby Vision level 5 metadata zero override setting
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39209"
msgid "Dolby Vision: Override level 5 metadata to zero"
msgstr "Dolby Vision: Åsidosätt metadata på nivå 5 till noll"

#. Help text for setting "Dolby Vision: Override level 5 metadata to zero" of
#. label #39209
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39210"
msgid ""
"If enabled, Dolby Vision files will have level 5 (active area) metadata "
"overridden to zero offsets. Enable if your display has issues with "
"incorrectly cropped image in Dolby Vision playback."
msgstr ""
"Om denna funktion är aktiverad kommer metadata för nivå 5 (aktivt område) i "
"Dolby Vision-filer att ersättas med nollförskjutningar. Aktivera denna "
"funktion om din skärm har problem med felaktigt beskärda bilder vid "
"uppspelning av Dolby Vision."

#. Title of the setting that skips subtitles whose language matches the audio
#. language
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39211"
msgid "Don't show subtitles matching the audio language"
msgstr "Visa inte undertexter som matchar ljudspråket"

#. Help text for setting "Don't show subtitles matching the audio language" of
#. label #39211
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39212"
msgid ""
"Do not turn on subtitles that are in the same language as the audio being "
"played. Forced subtitles are not affected."
msgstr ""
"Slå inte på undertexter som har samma språk som det uppspelade ljudet. "
"Tvingade undertexter påverkas inte."

#. Title of the setting that chooses which audio stream a library list
#. describes
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39213"
msgid "Language details to display"
msgstr "Språkinformation att visa"

#. Help text for setting "Language details to display" of label #39213
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39214"
msgid ""
"Which audio stream the language, codec and channel count shown against an "
"item describe.[CR][Player][Default] The language that will normally be "
"played.[CR][Media default] The default language for the media. If not set, "
"then the best audio stream is shown.[CR][Best] The best audio stream as "
"determined by codec quality and channel count."
msgstr ""
"Vilken ljudström som språk, kodek och kanalantal som visas för ett objekt "
"beskriver.[CR][Spelare][Standard] Språket som normalt spelas "
"upp.[CR][Mediets standard] Mediets standardspråk. Om det inte har angetts "
"visas den bästa ljudströmmen.[CR][Bäst] Den bästa ljudströmmen, avgjord av "
"kodekkvalitet och kanalantal."

#. Value of the setting "Language details to display" - describe the stream
#. that will be played
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39215"
msgid "Player"
msgstr "Spelare"

# Suggested in Weblate: Mediastandard
#. Value of the setting "Language details to display" - describe the media's
#. default stream
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39216"
msgid "Media default"
msgstr "Mediets standard"

#. Value of the setting "Language details to display" - describe the
#. technically best stream
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39217"
msgid "Best"
msgstr "Bäst"

#. empty strings from id 39211 to 39899
#. List formatting: pattern used to join a list of exactly two items, e.g. "A
#. and B"
#. STR_LIST_AND_TWO
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39900"
msgid "{0} and {1}"
msgstr "{0} och {1}"

#. List formatting: pattern used to join the first item to the rest of a list
#. of three or more items, e.g. "A" + "B, and C" -> "A, B, and C"
#. Note the "B, and C" is used here as an example - the actual formatting of
#. the last two item(s) of a list of three of more is determined by
#. STR_LIST_AND_END
#. STR_LIST_AND_START
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39901"
msgid "{0}, {1}"
msgstr "{0}, {1}"

#. List formatting: pattern used to join an already-combined partial list to
#. the next item, for the interior items of a list of four or more, e.g. "A,
#. B" + "C" -> "A, B, C"
#. STR_LIST_AND_MIDDLE
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39902"
msgid "{0}, {1}"
msgstr "{0}, {1}"

#. List formatting: pattern used to join the already-combined partial list to
#. the final item in a list of three or more items, e.g. "A, B" + "C" -> "A,
#. B, and C"
#. STR_LIST_AND_END
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39903"
msgid "{0}, and {1}"
msgstr "{0}, och {1}"

#. 39904 to 39909 are reserved for language formatting
#. List formatting: pattern used to join a list of exactly two items, e.g. "A
#. or B"
#. STR_LIST_OR_TWO
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39910"
msgid "{0} or {1}"
msgstr "{0} eller {1}"

#. List formatting: pattern used to join the already-combined partial list to
#. the final item in a list of three or more items, e.g. "A, B" + "C" -> "A,
#. B, or C"
#. Note: the "or"-type list uses only TWO and END patterns; the START and
#. MIDDLE joins for lists of three or more still use the AND-type comma
#. pattern
#. (STR_LIST_AND_START / STR_LIST_AND_MIDDLE), with only the very last join
#. switching to "or"
#. STR_LIST_OR_END
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#39911"
msgid "{0}, or {1}"
msgstr "{0}, eller {1}"

