#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#40222"
msgid "Group the different versions of videos"
msgstr "Gruppera olika versioner av videor"

#. "The newly scanned versions replace the default versions of movies" setting
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#40223"
msgid "Make the most recent version the default version"
msgstr "Gör den senaste versionen till standardversion"

#. Help for setting New versions replace the default versions
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#40224"
msgid ""
"Make the most recently scanned version of a movie the movie's default "
"version.[CR]Helps identify new movie versions as recently added and locate "
"them when the \"Unwatched\" filter of the library is turned on."
msgstr ""
"Gör den senast skannade versionen av en film till filmens "
"standardversion.[CR]Hjälper till att identifiera nya filmversioner som "
"nyligen tillagda och hitta dem när bibliotekets filter ”Ospelat” är "
"aktiverat."

#. Setting to determine when art is retrieved - during or after scrape
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#40225"
msgid "Retrieve art"
msgstr "Hämta bilder"

#. Help for retrieve art during/after scrape setting
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#40226"
msgid ""
"Determines whether art is retrieved synchronously during scrape or in the "
"background afterwards.[CR][During scrape] Art is retrieved synchronously "
"during scrape. This significantly extends time taken to scrape.[CR][After "
"scrape][Default] Art is retrieved in the background after scrape. Actor "
"thumbnails may take a while to appear."
msgstr ""
"Avgör om bilder hämtas synkront under skrapning eller i bakgrunden "
"efteråt.[CR][Under skrapning] Bilder hämtas synkront under skrapningen. "
"Detta förlänger skrapningstiden avsevärt.[CR][Efter skrapning][Standard] "
"Bilder hämtas i bakgrunden efter skrapningen. Det kan ta en stund innan "
"skådespelarnas miniatyrbilder visas."

#. Option for the retrieve art during/after scrape setting
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#40227"
msgid "During scrape"
msgstr "Under skrapning"

#. Option for the retrieve art during/after scrape setting
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#40228"
msgid "After scrape"
msgstr "Efter skrapning"

#. "Flatten movie versions" setting
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#40229"
msgid "Flatten movie versions"
msgstr "Platta ut filmversioner"

#. Help for setting Flatten movie versions
#, ignore-long-untranslated, ignore-multiple-failures, ignore-optional-plural
msgctxt "#40230"
msgid ""
"Turn on to show individual versions in the movies view, turn off to group "
